#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 515, "(4)") EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 515, "(5)") EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 718.3, "(8)") EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 718.3, "(7)") EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 726.21, "") EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 726.21, "(1)") EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 726.2, "") EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 810.03, "(4)") EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 810.03, "(3)") EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 108, "(1)") EQUALS NOTHING

-- 3.01(1): in a listed provision, the four named offences are within the phrase; any other offence is not covered; in an unlisted provision, nothing is said.
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence that is of a sexual nature or that is committed for a sexual purpose` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence under section 264 (criminal harassment)` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence under section 279.01 (trafficking in persons)` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence under section 279.011 (trafficking of a person under the age of 18 years)` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence that is none of those` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence under section 264 (criminal harassment)` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence under section 264 (criminal harassment)` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The two real functions composed: s 515(6) is listed, s 515(5) is not.
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence under section 264 (criminal harassment)` (`s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 515, "(6)")) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3.01(1) the offence counts as an offence in the commission of which violence is used, threatened or attempted against any person or class of persons` `an offence under section 264 (criminal harassment)` (`s 3.01(2) subsection (1) applies with respect to the provision` (`Provision of the Code` OF 515, "(5)")) EQUALS NOTHING
